        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2672] If the EVCC selected the service parameter MobilityNeedsMode set to 2 and EVCC receives a DC_ChargeLoopRes message with DepartureTime, TargetSOC or MinimumSOC, and if the EVCC cannot accept this DepartureTime, TargetSOC or MinimumSOC, e.g. for internal reasons, then the EVCC shall send different values in a DC_ChargeLoopReq than the values in DC_ChargeLoopRes within the number of seconds stated in AckMaxDelay of the DC_ChargeLoopRes.",
